  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Implement FlashAttention with Online Softmax** by following direct mathematical principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport torch, math\n\ndef inference_flash_attention_online_softmax(Q: list, K: list, V: list, block_size: int = 2) -> list:\n    q, k, v = torch.tensor(Q, dtype=torch.float32), torch.tensor(K, dtype=torch.float32), torch.tensor(V, dtype=torch.float32)\n    attn = torch.softmax(torch.matmul(q, k.transpose(-2, -1)) / math.sqrt(q.shape[-1]), dim=-1)\n    return torch.round(torch.matmul(attn, v), decimals=4).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the size of the primary input.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
